---

<section id="build" class="reveal border-b border-stone-800/70 py-16 sm:py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-50 sm:text-4xl">
      Lohen Build: Weapons, Artifacts, Teams &amp; Skills
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-400">
      Lohen is a front-line Cryo polearm DPS. His damage lives in the
      <span class="font-semibold text-frost-600">Hexerei chains</span> and the enhanced
      <span class="font-semibold text-frost-600">Elemental Skill</span> during the Masterstroke
      window. Build him for CRIT and ATK, run a Cryo DMG goblet, and keep 120-130% Energy Recharge
      so the Burst is ready every rotation.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <div class="flex gap-3 rounded-xl border border-frost-700/40 bg-frost-950/20 p-5">
        <img src="/weapons/weapon-disaster.webp" alt="Disaster and Remorse weapon icon" width="256" height="256" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="h-12 w-12 shrink-0 rounded-xl border border-stone-700/50 bg-white/60" />
        <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
          <p class="overline text-xs">Best Weapon</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-base font-bold text-slate-100">Disaster and Remorse</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
            Signature polearm. CRIT DMG plus a Hexerei-chain bonus active for the full window.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-3 rounded-xl border border-frost-700/40 bg-frost-950/20 p-5">
        <img src="/artifacts/art-risingwinds.webp" alt="A Day Carved From Rising Winds artifact icon" width="256" height="256" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="h-12 w-12 shrink-0 rounded-xl border border-stone-700/50 bg-white/60" />
        <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
          <p class="overline text-xs">Best Artifact Set</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-base font-bold text-slate-100">A Day Carved From Rising Winds</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
            4pc BiS. Its CRIT bonuses are active for the entire Masterstroke window.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-3 rounded-xl border border-frost-700/40 bg-frost-950/20 p-5">
        <img src="/elements/elem-cryo.webp" alt="Cryo element icon" width="256" height="256" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="h-12 w-12 shrink-0 rounded-xl border border-stone-700/50 bg-white/60" />
        <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
          <p class="overline text-xs">Main Stats</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-base font-bold text-slate-100">ATK% · Cryo DMG · CRIT</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
            ATK% sands, Cryo DMG goblet, CRIT circlet. Substats: CRIT Rate &gt; CRIT DMG &gt; ATK%.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-3 rounded-xl border border-frost-700/40 bg-frost-950/20 p-5">
        <img src="/talents/lohen-skill.webp" alt="Lohen Elemental Skill icon" width="256" height="256" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="h-12 w-12 shrink-0 rounded-xl border border-stone-700/50 bg-white/60" />
        <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
          <p class="overline text-xs">Stat Targets</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-base font-bold text-slate-100">50% CR · 150% CD · 120-130% ER</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
            50% CRIT Rate effective (42% + 8% passive), 1,800+ ATK, 120-130% Energy Recharge.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="mt-14 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-50">Best Weapons</h3>
    <div class="mt-5 rounded-2xl border border-gold-500/50 bg-gold-950/40 p-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <img
          src={weapons.signature.icon}
          alt={`${weapons.signature.name} weapon icon`}
          width="256"
          height="256"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          class="h-16 w-16 shrink-0 rounded-xl border border-gold-500/40 bg-white/60"
        />
        <div class="flex flex-1 flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-x-4 gap-y-1">
          <p class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-100">{weapons.signature.name}</p>
          <span class="shrink-0 rounded-full border border-gold-500/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-gold-600">
            Signature
          </span>
          <span class="w-full shrink-0 font-mono text-xs text-stone-500">{weapons.signature.stat}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-400">{weapons.signature.why}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
      {weapons.fiveStar.map((w) => (
        <div class="flex gap-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-800 bg-stone-900/30 p-5">
          <img
            src={w.icon}
            alt={`${w.name} weapon icon`}
            width="256"
            height="256"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            class="h-14 w-14 shrink-0 self-start rounded-xl border border-stone-700/50 bg-white/60"
          />
          <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
            <p class="font-semibold text-stone-100">{w.name}</p>
            <p class="mt-0.5 font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed text-stone-500">{w.stat}</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-400">{w.why}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <div class="mt-4 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
      {weapons.f2p.map((w) => (
        <div class="flex gap-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-800 bg-stone-900/30 p-5">
          <img
            src={w.icon}
            alt={`${w.name} weapon icon`}
            width="256"
            height="256"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            class="h-14 w-14 shrink-0 self-start rounded-xl border border-stone-700/50 bg-white/60"
          />
          <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
            <p class="font-semibold text-stone-100">{w.name}</p>
            <p class="mt-0.5 font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed text-stone-500">{w.stat}</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-400">{w.why}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <h3 class="mt-14 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-50">Best Artifacts</h3>
    <div class="mt-5 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
      {artifacts.map((a) => (
        <div class="flex gap-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-800 bg-stone-900/30 p-5">
          <img
            src={a.icon}
            alt={`${a.name.replace(" (4pc)", "")} artifact icon`}
            width="256"
            height="256"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            class="h-16 w-16 shrink-0 self-start rounded-xl border border-stone-700/60"
          />
          <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
            <p class="font-semibold text-stone-100">{a.name}</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-400">{a.why}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <div class="mt-6 overflow-x-auto">
      <table class="w-full min-w-[32rem] border-collapse text-sm">
        <thead>
          <tr class="text-left">
            <th class="py-3 pr-4 font-medium text-stone-500">Slot</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-stone-500">Main stat</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-stone-500">Sub-stat priority</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {artifactStats.map((s, i) => (
            <tr class={i === artifactStats.length - 1 ? "" : "border-b border-stone-800/70"}>
              <td class="py-4 pr-4 text-stone-300">{s.slot}</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-100">{s.main}</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-300">{s.sub}</td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <h3 class="mt-14 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-50">Goal Stats</h3>
    <div class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-4">
      {goalStats.map((g) => (
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-stone-800 bg-stone-900/30 p-4">
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-500">{g.k}</p>
          <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-lg font-semibold text-frost-400">{g.v}</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-stone-400">{g.note}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <h3 class="mt-14 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-50">Energy Recharge Requirements</h3>
    <div class="mt-5 overflow-x-auto">
      <table class="w-full min-w-[30rem] border-collapse text-sm">
        <thead>
          <tr class="text-left">
            <th class="py-3 pr-4 font-medium text-stone-500">Team setup</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-stone-500">ER needed</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {erRequirements.map((r, i) => (
            <tr class={i === erRequirements.length - 1 ? "" : "border-b border-stone-800/70"}>
              <td class="py-4 pr-4 text-stone-300">{r.setup}</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-4 font-mono text-frost-400">{r.er}</td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-stone-500">
      Lohen's Skill generates 3-4 Cryo particles per cast, so external particles from teammates
      are still needed to fuel the 80-cost Burst each cycle.
    </p>

    <h3 class="mt-14 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-50">Best Teams</h3>
    <div class="mt-5 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
      {teams.map((t) => (
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-stone-800 bg-stone-900/30 p-5">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2">
            <p class="font-semibold text-stone-100">{t.name}</p>
            <span
              class={`shrink-0 rounded-full border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium ${
                t.tag === "F2P"
                  ? "border-emerald-700/50 bg-emerald-950/30 text-emerald-600"
                  : "border-stone-700 text-stone-500"
              }`}
            >
              {t.tag}
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
            {t.ava.map((a) => (
              <img
                src={a}
                alt=""
                width="256"
                height="256"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
                class="h-9 w-9 shrink-0 rounded-full border border-stone-700/60 bg-white/60"
              />
            ))}
            <span class="min-w-0 text-xs text-stone-500">{t.members}</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-400">{t.why}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <h3 class="mt-14 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-50">Skills</h3>
    <div class="mt-5 space-y-4">
      {skills.map((s) => (
        <div class="flex gap-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-800 bg-stone-900/30 p-5">
          <img
            src={s.icon}
            alt={`${s.name} icon`}
            width="256"
            height="256"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            class="h-14 w-14 shrink-0 self-start rounded-xl border border-stone-700/50 bg-white/60"
          />
          <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
              <p class="font-semibold text-stone-100">{s.name}</p>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="rounded-full border border-stone-700 px-3 py-0.5 text-xs text-stone-500">
                  {s.tag}
                </span>
                <span class="rounded-full border border-frost-700/50 bg-frost-950/30 px-3 py-0.5 text-xs text-frost-600">
                  {s.priority}
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-400">{s.desc}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-frost-700/40 bg-frost-950/20 p-6">
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-300">
        <span class="font-semibold text-stone-100">Talent priority:</span> Elemental Skill first,
        then Normal Attack, and the Burst last. The Skill is the highest single-hit multiplier and
        opens Masterstroke; the Hexerei chains (which scale with Normal Attack) are your sustained
        damage.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h3 class="mt-14 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-50">Passive Talents</h3>
    <div class="mt-5 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
      {passives.map((p) => (
        <div class="flex gap-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-800 bg-stone-900/30 p-5">
          <img
            src={p.icon}
            alt={`${p.name} icon`}
            width="256"
            height="256"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            class="h-12 w-12 shrink-0 self-start rounded-xl border border-stone-700/50 bg-white/60"
          />
          <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
            <p class="font-semibold text-stone-100">{p.name}</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-400">{p.desc}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <h3 class="mt-14 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-50">Constellation Priority</h3>
    <div class="mt-5 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
      {constellations.map((c, i) => (
        <div class="flex gap-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-800 bg-stone-900/30 p-4">
          <span
            class="flex h-14 w-14 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-frost-600/40 bg-frost-950/60 text-frost-600"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" class="h-10 w-10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              {constellationPatterns[i].slice(1).map((p, j) => (
                <line x1={constellationPatterns[i][j][0]} y1={constellationPatterns[i][j][1]} x2={p[0]} y2={p[1]} />
              ))}
              {constellationPatterns[i].map((p) => (
                <circle cx={p[0]} cy={p[1]} r="4" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" />
              ))}
            </svg>
          </span>
          <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
              <span class="font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-frost-600">{c.c}</span>
              <span class="shrink-0 rounded-full border border-stone-700 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-xs text-stone-500">
                {c.uplift}
              </span>
            </div>
            <p class={`mt-2 text-xs font-medium ${c.verdict === "Best value" ? "font-semibold text-gold-600" : "text-stone-500"}`}>{c.verdict}</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-400">{c.note}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p class="mt-4 text-xs leading-relaxed text-stone-500">
      Uplift figures are relative to a C0 baseline, from the 6.6 beta kit cross-checked with
      community testing on HoYoLAB.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-frost-700/40 bg-frost-950/20 p-6">
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-300">
        <span class="font-semibold text-stone-100">Investment guide:</span> Pull him at C0 and
        stop — both his weapon and constellations are optional. C1 is the best-value stop,
        extending Masterstroke uptime by ~20%. After C1, prioritize the signature weapon, which
        provides a larger damage increase than C2 for fewer Primogems. Only chase C6 for
        challenge-mode optimization.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
